won't be any money.

> suggest we
> need a way to disqualify items in the projects list.

I agree that the voting up or down system had certain advantages: it is
not obvious now whether a proposal didn't get any points because it is
considered bad or just because noone voted. But I guess we'll just have
to do with it as it is.

Claudia

